('2026-11-24', 'ChatGPT / AI-02', 'Added a separate corporate umbrella website prototype under corporate/: parent-company landing page plus four distinct business-division websites (CashDublo Digital, CashDublo Learning, CashDublo Studio, Get Cash Platform), shared responsive CSS and accessible mobile navigation, and architecture/acceptance documentation. Existing root site remains unchanged. Cash Flow is presented as a proposed umbrella brand; divisions are not represented as legally formed subsidiaries. Feature branch only; no merge or deployment.', 'corporate/index.html; corporate/digital/index.html; corporate/learning/index.html; corporate/studio/index.html; corporate/get-cash/index.html; corporate/assets/corporate.css; corporate/assets/corporate.js; corporate/ARCHITECTURE.md; corporate/README.md');